@startuml
title Admin - Thống kê kết quả khảo sát
autonumber
hide footbox
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
actor Admin
boundary "Admin Portal" as Web
control "AdminSurveyStatsController" as Controller
control "AdminReportService" as Service
database "SurveyRepository" as DB

Admin -> Web: Mở thống kê khảo sát
Web -> Controller: GET /api/manager/surveys/stats
Controller -> Service: surveyStats()
Service -> DB: countByDeletedAtIsNull()
Service -> DB: countByStatusAndDeletedAtIsNull(DRAFT)
Service -> DB: countByStatusAndDeletedAtIsNull(PUBLISHED)
DB --> Service: Tổng, bản nháp, đã phát hành
Service --> Controller: Map thống kê
Controller --> Web: 200 stats
Web --> Admin: Hiển thị số liệu khảo sát
note over Controller,DB
  Source: AdminSurveyStatsController, AdminReportService.surveyStats()
end note
@enduml
